    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This report presents the work done during the the CUREe-Kajima research project \"Hysteresis Modeling of Reinforced Concrete Bridge Members Subjected to Combined Loading\". Two major tasks are addressed in this report:\r\n• the verification of the fiber model for modeling the hysteresis of reinforced concrete\r\ncolumns subjected to bilateral loading and varying axial load, and\r\n• the development of an improved stand alone cross-section analysis program, NcS.\r\nThe report concludes with a summary of the results achieved and outlines of research opportunities\r\narising out of this project.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Murayama, Yasuo and Tokuyama, Seiji and Furuichi, Kosuke and Ukon, Hachiro and Hishiki, Yoshihiro and Inoue, Norio and Mahin, Stephen and Thewalt, Christopher and Yin, Changrui and Stojadinovic, Bozidar. (1991). Hysteresis Modeling of Reinforced Concrete Members Subjected to Combined Loading. CUREE- Kajima Research Project Report CKI-04. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/dr093kj2343",
            "type": "preferred citation",
            "identifier": [],
            "displayLabel": "Preferred Citation",
            "note": [],
